Debug.Assert(New_Ret &gt;= -1 &amp;&amp; Old_arrListCount != -1);
</code>

The purpose of this assert statement is to check if the return value of the `LastIndexOf` method is negative, in that case, the `Count` of the `ArrayList` should not be -1. This ensures that the `ArrayList` is not in an invalid state when attempting to find the last index of a value.
